MUDIDI Dataset — Licensing

Source dictionary page images (PDFs under each dictionary's "Dictionary pages" and
"Introduction" folders) are derived from public-domain materials digitized via
HathiTrust. Consult the original volume for any residual usage constraints.

Human annotations (Stage 1 gold TSV/flat transcripts, Stage 2 gold MDF records,
field cheat sheets, and alphabet lists) are released under:

  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Software used to produce this release (the MUDIDI pipeline in this repository)
is provided separately under the repository license.
